    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE EXCISE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 52)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      252.79,
      401.69,
      278.85
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      290.83,
      401.62,
      316.89
    ],
    "text": "1.(1) This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      328.99,
      402.11,
      355.05
    ],
    "text": "(2) The provisions of this Act shall for all purposes bedeemed to have come into operation on November 19, 2010.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      367.03,
      401.85,
      418.53
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) ishereby amended by the repeal of paragraphs (b) and (c) ofthat section, and the substitution therefor of thefollowing :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.13,
      430.51,
      401.88,
      456.57
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)no tree producing toddy, other than the kithul treeand the palmyrah tree, shall be tapped ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      468.67,
      401.71,
      494.73
    ],
    "text": "(c)no toddy shall be drawn from any tree, other thanthe kithul tree and the palmayrah tree.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      505.15,
      402.05,
      530.13
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
